      "quote": "Do they offer ATSpaces? No provider says so today, and the hosted alpha server isn't for real use, so the trial runs on a throwaway host.\nWho handles abuse? Accounts under Spell.spaces can post publicly, which brings moderation, terms and a privacy policy.",
